<title>UK: Rolls Royce names Heiden industrial power head.</title>
<headline>Rolls Royce names Heiden industrial power head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering conglomerate Rolls-Royce Plc named on Friday Paul Heiden as managing director of its industrial power group with effect from July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Heiden, currently the finance director of the aerospace group, will also become one of the group's executive directors.</p>
<p>The industrial power group contributes 27 percent to Rolls-Royce' annnual group turnover.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
